# Documentation

- One H1 per file, matching the topic.
- Date plus source on interview notes (`docs/01-current-process/sources/`).
- Use mermaid for process and architecture flows; keep node IDs without spaces.
- Link glossary terms instead of redefining them.
- Requirements: stable IDs (`FR-001`, `NFR-001`), one testable capability, no n8n node names.
- Spec stubs: fill sections in place; do not create a parallel tree.
- Do not paste production case content, personal data, or secrets.
- Record product choices as ADRs in `docs/06-decisions/`.
